Please be aware of this bar. They are all group of thieves. I paid 2500/- for a bill of 2153/- where they were supposed to return me 347/- but instead they returned me 250/-
When I asked about this, shamelessly they were watching my face.
@BMC please close this place asap. There should not be an alcoholic place near the school premises.
